# 4. USE CASE 15: CLAIM LEAD (SALES AGENTS TRANH CHẤP LEAD)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Sales Agent 1 thực hiện Claim Lead thành công -> Mong đợi: 200 OK + Trả thông tin Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjEyLCJwaG9uZSI6IjAxMjM0NTY3ODgiLCJyb2xlIjoiU0FMRVNfQUdFTlQiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUwNzMzNDIsImV4cCI6MTc4NTY3ODE0Mn0.39d3pRQGxEUxnB35IPhxc-nxfY9hWp9-ycXNPk--2ho



### 4.2 Sales Agent 2 cố gắng Claim cùng Lead đó -> Mong đợi: 409 Conflict ("This request has already been claimed...")
POST {{baseUrl}}/leads/{{leadId}}/claim
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOjI1LCJwaG9uZSI6IjAxMjM0NTY3ODYiLCJyb2xlIjoiU0FMRVNfQUdFTlQiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODUwNzMzODgsImV4cCI6MTc4NTY3ODE4OH0.LywIGZaoHZH3BOWLE5vBBtAnBUzlTKhp09gXIRG_0OI
